      "value": "<p>A military-specification extended barrel with a reinforced acceleration chamber and precision-tuned coil spacing. Rounds exit with significantly greater force than a standard barrel configuration allows, and the added length improves accuracy over the weapon's effective range as a secondary benefit. Compatible with any ranged weapon. Grants a +2 item bonus to weapon damage rolls.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> - Install on weapon during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p><hr/><p><em>Installation: Drag it onto a weapon in your inventory to install it. It affects only that weapon. The +2 is added to this weapon's damage.</em></p>"
